{
  "$schema": "http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#",
  "title": "compute RayQuery codegen 冒烟证据 schema(G7.2 W3a,步骤 93;G-G7-4;RFC-0018 章 A/B)",
  "description": "ci/ray_query_codegen_smoke.py 写 evidence/ray_query_codegen_smoke_<ts>.json。host/compile 段恒跑六项:① rayquery 语料 accept 零诊断 + reject 全拦截(RXS-0297~0299);② vulkan_codegen 锚定单测(1.4 分叉 / capability+extension 按需 / 反汇编 golden / initialize 操作数序与冻结 flags / interface 全量 / 1.0 零漂移锚点 / spirv-val 双口径);③ 真实 .rx → .spv 且 spirv-val --target-env vulkan1.2 与 spv1.4 双口径皆 accept(退出码判定,不 grep stdout);④ 反汇编 golden 最小集(per-file 必含项 + 语料并集覆盖 terminate / intersection-type / committed 五查询族,因 RXS-0298 明定 terminate 可选、committed 族按真实使用);⑤ W1/W2 五 kernel 对 tests/vulkan/w1w2_spv_manifest.json 的 sha256 + SPIR-V 版本 + capability 集合逐项零漂移且不得误声明 ray query 面;⑥ 篡改 .spv → spirv-val 必拒的 RED 反证。device 段(最小 hit/miss/属性查询 kernel 真跑)gate real:硬前置 = G7.3 W3b compute AS descriptor,未在树时 device_blocked 记 blocked-honest 并 SKIP,RURIX_REQUIRE_REAL=1 翻硬红——host 段绿不冒充 device 绿(RFC-0016 §4.E3 条件臂 / §9.1 R-3)。",
  "type": "object",
  "additionalProperties": false,
  "required": [
    "schema_version",
    "subject",
    "milestone",
    "step",
    "spec_clauses",
    "host_section_pass",
    "device_section_rc",
    "checks",
    "run_url",
    "timestamp"
  ],
  "properties": {
    "schema_version": {
      "type": "integer",
      "const": 1
    },
    "subject": {
      "type": "string",
      "const": "ray_query_codegen_smoke"
    },
    "milestone": {
      "type": "string"
    },
    "step": {
      "type": "integer",
      "const": 93
    },
    "spec_clauses": {
      "type": "array",
      "items": {
        "type": "string",
        "pattern": "^RXS-[0-9]{4}$"
      },
      "minItems": 1
    },
    "host_section_pass": {
      "type": "boolean"
    },
    "device_section_rc": {
      "type": "integer"
    },
    "device_blocked": {
      "type": [
        "string",
        "null"
      ]
    },
    "device_probe_note": {
      "type": [
        "string",
        "null"
      ]
    },
    "checks": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "properties": {
        "corpus_pass": {
          "type": [
            "boolean",
            "string"
          ]
        },
        "codegen_unit_pass": {
          "type": [
            "boolean",
            "string"
          ]
        },
        "emit_pass": {
          "type": [
            "boolean",
            "string"
          ]
        },
        "w1w2_zero_drift_pass": {
          "type": [
            "boolean",
            "string"
          ]
        },
        "red_tamper_pass": {
          "type": [
            "boolean",
            "string"
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    "modules": {
      "type": "object",
      "description": "逐 accept 语料的编码事实:SPIR-V 版本、spirv-val 双口径判定、产物 sha256、committed 查询族与 golden 助记符命中集。",
      "additionalProperties": {
        "type": "object",
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "properties": {
          "spirv_version": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "spirv_val": {
            "type": "object",
            "additionalProperties": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          },
          "sha256": {
            "type": "string",
            "pattern": "^[0-9a-f]{64}$"
          },
          "committed_queries": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          },
          "golden_mnemonics": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          }
        }
      }
